<title>NETHERLANDS: AKZO NOBEL Q1 NET UP 2.4 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>AKZO NOBEL Q1 NET UP 2.4 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First qtr 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     4.78 vs   4.67</p>
<p>    Total net			    340    vs 332</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  5.84 vs   5.64</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected chemicals group Akzo Nobel NV</p>
<p>to report a 1997 first quarter net profit from ordinary</p>
<p>operations of between 332 million and 380 million guilders.</p>
<p>    Total operating costs (bln)	5.31 vs   5.15</p>
<p>    Operating income		   528    vs 494</p>
<p>    Financing charges		   68    vs  64</p>
<p>    Tax				    133    vs 125</p>
<p>    Associates' income		  22    vs  35</p>
<p>    Minorities' charge		   9    vs   8</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
